{"id":"6cd614fd2298b74e","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence.md","title":"ZFC Prob4 Lp Convergence","display":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence — ZFC Prob4 Lp Convergence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence","aliases":["58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence"],"display":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence — ZFC Prob4 Lp Convergence","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-probability-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence — ZFC Prob4 Lp Convergence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0578a357a86e9d8f\" href=\"?note=0578a357a86e9d8f\" title=\"58-df-probability-space\">58-df-probability-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cebc92aa41f3a49c\" href=\"?note=cebc92aa41f3a49c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable\">58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X\\in V\">\\(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的六元偏函数；定义域为同一概率空间上的两个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> 实随机变量及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in[1,\\infty)\">\\(p\\in[1,\\infty)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in V\">\\(d\\in V\\)</span>；下式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 是距离的值。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Z,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,Z,p)=d\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\n\\{\\langle w,|Y(w)-Z(w)|^p\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land d=r^{1/p}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Z,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,Z,p)=d\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\n\\{\\langle w,|Y(w)-Z(w)|^p\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land d=r^{1/p}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\in n\\lor N=n\n\\to\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),X,p)&lt;\\epsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\in n\\lor N=n\n\\to\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),X,p)&lt;\\epsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&lt;\\infty\">\\(p&lt;\\infty\\)</span>、随机变量代表元及原有六元收敛接口；距离仍是原先意指的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^p\">\\(L^p\\)</span> 距离。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-probability-space","status":"resolved","id":"0578a357a86e9d8f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-probability-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable","status":"resolved","id":"cebc92aa41f3a49c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-random-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S:V^5\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in[1,\\infty)","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Z,p)\\\\\n&\\quad\\to\\Bigl[\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,Y,Z,p)=d\n\\leftrightarrow\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S(r,\n\\{\\langle w,|Y(w)-Z(w)|^p\\rangle:w\\in\\Omega\\},\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land d=r^{1/p}\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}prob4\\text{-}lp\\text{-}convergence}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpConvergence}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X,X,p)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{ProbabilitySpace}(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P)\n\\land p\\in[1,\\infty)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,\\omega,\\mathbb R^\\Omega)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),p)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcProb4LpRandomVariable}_S(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,X,p)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\epsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\exists N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nN\\in n\\lor N=n\n\\to\n\\operatorname{LpDistance}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\vec X(n),X,p)<\\epsilon\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"p<\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"L^p","display":false}],"bytes":2631,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence.md|58-df-zfc-prob4-lp-convergence]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","0578a357a86e9d8f","cebc92aa41f3a49c","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d"]}